:"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116469\r\n\r\nCurrently a draft PR, until the origin of the problem is correctly identified and corrected.\r\nWell aware that I will have to do the following as I already messed up from the workflow:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/creating_pull_requests.html#issuing-a-pull-request:~:text=rebase%20your%20branch%20to%20squash%20some%20or%20all%20of%20the%20commits%20into%20one.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\n[2026-02-19, 21:58 UTC-5]\r\nCalling _draw_grid() and update_grid() earlier fixes the problem, so another process is most likely called earlier than previously was in v4.5.1-stable. Still investigating the issue.\r\n\r\n[2026-02-21, 00:03 UTC-5]\r\nIn ```void EditorNode::edit_item(Object *p_object, Object *p_editing_owner)```, the ```GridMapEditorPlugin``` enters ```to_over_edit.push_back(plugin);```. As a result, gets sent to ```_plugin_over_edit```, where:\r\n```\r\np_plugin->edit(p_object);\r\np_plugin->make_visible(true);\r\n```\r\nWhen switching between GridMaps, the plugin is already activated, and enters another if clause, where:\r\n```\r\np_plugin->make_visible(true);\r\np_plugin->edit(p_object);\r\n```\r\nThe second option works.\r\n\r\n[2026-02-24, 17:28 UTC-5]\r\nExpected process in EditorNode, undraft\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url